2025-05-01 00:51:38 - Thread-104 (execute) - INFO - [Exploration]
Possible useful columns and how we will use them  

• PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT  
  – "id": join‑key for every patent.  
  – "title": text we have to return.  
  – "abstract": text we have to return.  
  – "date": publication date – will be filtered between 2014‑01‑01 and 2014‑02‑01 and used when computing “5‑year window” for forward citations.  
  – "country": keep only "US".  

• PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.CPC_CURRENT  
  – "patent_id": join‑key to PATENT."id".  
  – "subsection_id": allows biology / chemistry filter (between ‘C05’ and ‘C13’).  
  – "group_id": alternative biology / chemistry filter (A01G, A01H, A61K, A61P, A61Q, B01F, B01J, B81B, B82B, B82Y, G01N, G16H).  
  – "category": keep the most complete set (often ‘inventional’ or ‘additional’).  

• PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.USPATENTCITATION  
  – "patent_id": the citing patent → gives backward citations for that patent.  
  – "citation_id": the cited patent.  
  – "date": publication date of the cited patent (can be used to ensure it is earlier than the citing patent filing / grant date).  
  – will be used twice:  
     ▪ Backward count: WHERE c1."patent_id" = p."id".  
     ▪ Forward count: WHERE c2."citation_id" = p."id".  (then join c2."patent_id" with PATENT to get its publication date and restrict to 5‑year window).  

• PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.APPLICATION (optional if we decide to use application filing date, column "date").  

Main conditions that will appear  

1. p."date" BETWEEN '2014‑01‑01' AND '2014‑02‑01' (inclusive).  
2. p."country" = 'US'.  
3.  (  (cpc."subsection_id" BETWEEN 'C05' AND 'C13')  
     OR cpc."group_id" IN ('A01G','A01H','A61K','A61P','A61Q','B01F','B01J',  
                           'B81B','B82B','B82Y','G01N','G16H')  ).  
4. Backward citations: COUNT(DISTINCT c1."citation_id").  
5. Forward citations inside 5 years: COUNT(DISTINCT c2."patent_id")  
   WHERE p2."date" <= DATEADD(year,5,p."date").  

Below are ten exploratory SQLs (all capped at 20 rows) that gradually build the final logic.  
All identifiers are wrapped in double‑quotes, all queries end with LIMIT 20.

```sql
-- 1) Description: List U.S. patents published between 1‑Jan‑2014 and 1‑Feb‑2014.
SELECT p."id",
       p."title",
       p."date"
FROM   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT AS p
WHERE  p."country" = 'US'
  AND  p."date" BETWEEN '2014-01-01' AND '2014-02-01'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2) Description: Show distinct CPC subsections for the same date range.
SELECT DISTINCT cpc."subsection_id"
FROM   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT  AS p
JOIN   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.CPC_CURRENT AS cpc
       ON cpc."patent_id" = p."id"
WHERE  p."country" = 'US'
  AND  p."date" BETWEEN '2014-01-01' AND '2014-02-01'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3) Description: Retrieve patents in biology/chemistry domain (by subsection C05‑C13).
SELECT DISTINCT p."id",
       p."title",
       p."date",
       cpc."subsection_id"
FROM   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT        AS p
JOIN   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.CPC_CURRENT   AS cpc
       ON cpc."patent_id" = p."id"
WHERE  p."country" = 'US'
  AND  p."date" BETWEEN '2014-01-01' AND '2014-02-01'
  AND  cpc."subsection_id" BETWEEN 'C05' AND 'C13'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4) Description: Same as #3 but use the explicit group list instead of subsection range.
SELECT DISTINCT p."id",
       p."title",
       p."date",
       cpc."group_id"
FROM   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT      AS p
JOIN   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.CPC_CURRENT AS cpc
       ON cpc."patent_id" = p."id"
WHERE  p."country" = 'US'
  AND  p."date" BETWEEN '2014-01-01' AND '2014-02-01'
  AND  cpc."group_id" IN ('A01G','A01H','A61K','A61P','A61Q',
                          'B01F','B01J','B81B','B82B','B82Y',
                          'G01N','G16H')
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5) Description: Count backward citations for each candidate patent.
SELECT p."id"                           AS "patent_id",
       COUNT(DISTINCT c1."citation_id") AS "backward_cnt"
FROM   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT            AS p
JOIN   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.CPC_CURRENT       AS cpc
       ON cpc."patent_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.USPATENTCITATION AS c1
       ON c1."patent_id" = p."id"
WHERE  p."country" = 'US'
  AND  p."date" BETWEEN '2014-01-01' AND '2014-02-01'
  AND  cpc."subsection_id" BETWEEN 'C05' AND 'C13'
GROUP BY p."id"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6) Description: Preview forward citations within 5 years (needs citing patent date).
SELECT p."id"                              AS "patent_id",
       COUNT(DISTINCT c2."patent_id")      AS "forward_cnt_5y"
FROM   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT AS p
JOIN   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.CPC_CURRENT AS cpc
       ON cpc."patent_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.USPATENTCITATION AS c2
       ON c2."citation_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT AS p2     -- the citing patent
       ON p2."id" = c2."patent_id"
WHERE  p."country" = 'US'
  AND  p."date" BETWEEN '2014-01-01' AND '2014-02-01'
  AND  cpc."subsection_id" BETWEEN 'C05' AND 'C13'
  AND  p2."date" IS NOT NULL
  AND  p2."date" <= DATEADD(year,5,p."date")
GROUP BY p."id"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7) Description: Combine backward and forward counts together.
SELECT p."id"                                           AS "patent_id",
       COUNT(DISTINCT c1."citation_id")                 AS "backward_cnt",
       COUNT(DISTINCT CASE
                         WHEN p2."date" <= DATEADD(year,5,p."date")
                         THEN c2."patent_id"
                      END)                              AS "forward_cnt_5y"
FROM   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT AS p
JOIN   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.CPC_CURRENT AS cpc
       ON cpc."patent_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.USPATENTCITATION AS c1
       ON c1."patent_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.USPATENTCITATION AS c2
       ON c2."citation_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT AS p2
       ON p2."id" = c2."patent_id"
WHERE  p."country" = 'US'
  AND  p."date" BETWEEN '2014-01-01' AND '2014-02-01'
  AND  cpc."subsection_id" BETWEEN 'C05' AND 'C13'
GROUP BY p."id"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8) Description: List patents with the highest forward citations (limited list).
SELECT p."id",
       p."title",
       COUNT(DISTINCT CASE
                         WHEN p2."date" <= DATEADD(year,5,p."date")
                         THEN c2."patent_id"
                      END) AS "fwd_5y"
FROM   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT            AS p
JOIN   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.CPC_CURRENT       AS cpc
       ON cpc."patent_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.USPATENTCITATION  AS c2
       ON c2."citation_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT AS p2
       ON p2."id" = c2."patent_id"
WHERE  p."country" = 'US'
  AND  p."date" BETWEEN '2014-01-01' AND '2014-02-01'
  AND  cpc."subsection_id" BETWEEN 'C05' AND 'C13'
GROUP BY p."id",p."title"
ORDER BY "fwd_5y" DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9) Description: Patents with zero backward citations (after chemistry filter).
SELECT p."id",
       p."title"
FROM   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT      AS p
JOIN   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.CPC_CURRENT AS cpc
       ON cpc."patent_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.USPATENTCITATION AS c1
       ON c1."patent_id" = p."id"
WHERE  p."country" = 'US'
  AND  p."date" BETWEEN '2014-01-01' AND '2014-02-01'
  AND  cpc."subsection_id" BETWEEN 'C05' AND 'C13'
GROUP BY p."id",p."title"
HAVING COUNT(c1."citation_id") = 0
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10) Description: Final‑form query returning title, abstract, publication date,
--                 backward count and forward‑5‑year count (sample 20 rows).
SELECT p."id"                                         AS "patent_id",
       p."title",
       p."abstract",
       p."date"                                       AS "pub_date",
       COUNT(DISTINCT c1."citation_id")               AS "backward_cnt",
       COUNT(DISTINCT CASE
                         WHEN p2."date" <= DATEADD(year,5,p."date")
                         THEN c2."patent_id"
                      END)                            AS "forward_cnt_5y"
FROM   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT            AS p
JOIN   PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.CPC_CURRENT       AS cpc
       ON cpc."patent_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.USPATENTCITATION AS c1
       ON c1."patent_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.USPATENTCITATION AS c2
       ON c2."citation_id" = p."id"
LEFT JOIN PATENTSVIEW.PATENTSVIEW.PATENT          AS p2
       ON p2."id" = c2."patent_id"
WHERE  p."country" = 'US'
  AND  p."date" BETWEEN '2014-01-01' AND '2014-02-01'
  AND  (  cpc."subsection_id" BETWEEN 'C05' AND 'C13'
       OR cpc."group_id" IN ('A01G','A01H','A61K','A61P','A61Q',
                             'B01F','B01J','B81B','B82B','B82Y',
                             'G01N','G16H') )
GROUP BY p."id",p."title",p."abstract",p."date"
LIMIT 20;
```

